To win before the Heavy Assault C.A.T. appears, just deploy [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] ASAP and make sure it is protected by enough meatshields as well as [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]]. No items are needed. The [[Berserkory]] may appear when you are hitting the base, but with Octopus Cat blocking his [[Wave Attack]]s it is not an issue at all.

